        "created_at": "2017-03-27T23:14:59.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm here to stay!</p><p>I mean, I'm traveling Wednesday of this week through Monday of next, so it'll be sporadic if at all that I'm posting in those several days, but I am genuinely eager to be part of this community again. That is, if you all will be so kind as to have me back.&nbsp;</p><p>Been making a dent in the playtesting areas as well.&nbsp;</p>",
