        "created_at": "2019-08-07T17:55:04.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Non-foil cards and no redundant variants:</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>EE: 578 (41x10 + 27x4 + 15x4 = 410 + 108 + 60)</li>\n\t<li>RC: 222 (41x2 + 27x4 + 2/Operative + 15x2 = 82 + 108 +2 + 30)</li>\n\t<li>IR: 228 (41x2 + 27x4 + 8/Ennead + 15x2 = 82 + 108 +8 + 30)</li>\n\t<li>ST: 220 (41x2 + 27x4 + 15x2 = 82 + 108 + 30)</li>\n\t<li>Vengeance: 339 (41x5 + 4/Sentinels + 20x5 + 15x2 = 205 +4 + 100 + 30)</li>\n\t<li>WC: 224 (41x2 + 2/Sky-Scraper, 27x4 + 2/Kaargra + 15x2 = 82 +2 + 108 +2 + 30)</li>\n\t<li>Villains: 260 (20x10 + 15x4 = 200 + 60)</li>\n\t<li>OblivAeon: 392&nbsp;(41x5 + 25x4 + 5/Shield + 15x5 + 5/Turn Order + 2/Battlezone = 205&nbsp;+ 100 +5 +75 +5 +2)</li>\n\t<li>Mini-expansions: 537 (41x9 + 27x4 + 15x4 = 369 + 108 + 60)</li>\n\t<li>Variant Heroes: 67</li>\n\t<li>Variant Villains: 12 (Omni, BB, Spite, Gloom, Infinitor, Kismet, 2 each)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Total: 3,079</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Foil cards and new art/redundant variants:</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Complete Hero Variant Collection: 67 (New art, replacement for Kvothe, who is owned by Worldbuilders)</li>\n\t<li>Foil Hero Collection: 110 (New art)</li>\n\t<li>Foil Kvothe: 1</li>\n\t<li>Cleverest Legacy (unpublished): 1</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
