        "cooked": "<p>So i picked up a complete copy of Sentinels of the Multiverse Enhanced Edition with all content stored in the Ultimate Collectors Case.</p>\n<p>Now its time to sleeve, would 3300 Sleeve King Standard Cards ( 63.5x88mm) be enough for all non oversized cards.<br>\n:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Sentinels of the Multiverse Core Game</li>\n<li>Sentinels of the Multiverse: Rook City/Infernal Relics</li>\n<li>Sentinels of the Multiverse: Shattered Timelines</li>\n<li>Sentinels of the Multiverse: Vengeance</li>\n<li>Sentinels of the Multiverse: Wrath of the Cosmos</li>\n<li>Villains of the Multiverse</li>\n<li>Villains of the Multiverse</li>\n<li>Sentinels of the Multiverse: Mini-Expansions: (Unity, The Scholar, Guise, Ambuscade, Miss Information, Wager Master, Chokepoint, Silver Gulch 1883, The Final Wasteland, Omnitron IV, The Celestial Tribunal)</li>\n<li>SotM Extra Token Pack</li>\n<li>Oversized Villain Card Pack</li>\n<li>Sentinels of the Multiverse: OblivAeon</li>\n<li>Complete Hero Variant Collection</li>\n<li>5th Anniversary Foil Hero Collection</li>\n<li>Ultimate Collector’s Case</li>\n</ul>",
